    reply-reserve / close-thinking retry design
    (docs/specs/thinking-budget.md), the prefix-cache-safe prompt
    layout that floats volatile harness context after the stable
    transcript (server/docs/PIN_FRIENDLY_PROMPT.md), and byte-accounted
    tool-output memory where identical results share one block with its
    size kept in bytes (server/src/server/tool_memory.cpp), which informs
