    scratch for proxy/score_proxy.py. No code copied.

  ashhart/TensorFold (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold
    Agent-context compaction pre-pass
    (app/electron/agent/compaction-prepass.ts): byte-identical `tool`
    results after the first are replaced with a placeholder before the
    expensive summarization call, and summarized results keep their
    original size. Basis of the opt-in duplicate tool-output collapse and
    its position- and byte-count-preserving marker in
    proxy/score_proxy.py; reimplemented from scratch. No code copied.

